## Architecture

- Functional core: pure functions for logic, side effects at edges
- `cmd/` — Cobra commands, thin wrappers only
- `internal/` — app-private packages
- `pkg/` — reusable packages (display, helpers)

## Commands

- `task dev` — fmt + lint + test + build
- `task run -- <args>` — run without building
- `task test` — go test -v ./...

## Hard rules

- No business logic in `cmd/` — delegate to `internal/` or `pkg/`
- Pass `context.Context` as first parameter to all I/O functions
- Always wrap errors: `fmt.Errorf("context: %w", err)`
- No global mutable state — pass dependencies explicitly
- Go {{ go_version }}+, type hints on every exported function
